      "side": 1,
      "message": "This (moving the GL calls to FinalizeMapImpl()) seems like a good change to make regardless of Graphite/Dawn. In particular, the current implemention appears to make MapMode::Read a blocking call (since it doesn\u0027t and can\u0027t use GL_MAP_UNSYNCHRONIZED_BIT).\n\nCould you put up a preliminary CL to move mapping to FinalizeMapImpl()? It seems like we could also remove GL_MAP_UNSYNCHRONIZED_BIT for MapMode::Write in that change too, if I understand correctly.",
      "revId": "356774029c2d5f0927c9be02044475847c324d18",
