      "writtenOn": "2025-12-12T06:26:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`DestroyImpl` can be called explicitly by user.\n\nSo in this example, a race can happen:\n```\nwgpu::Texture texture \u003d device.CreateTexture(...);\n\n// texture\u0027s GL handle hasn\u0027t had a chance to be created.\ntexture.Destroy();\n```\n\nAdded a test.",
      "parentUuid": "769c5fef_48b65ec9",
      "revId": "356774029c2d5f0927c9be02044475847c324d18",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
